	<key>readme</key>
	<string>GitHub Repos

Type `gh` (then optional filter text) to search every GitHub repo visible to the active gh account — personal, collaborator, and org repos across all your memberships.

Selecting a repo opens it in your default browser. If a Chrome or Safari tab is already open with that URL, the existing tab is focused instead of opening a new one.

Type `gh-switch` to switch the active gh account on github.com. The repo list is cached per-account, so switching accounts shows the right set of repos.

Requirements:
- gh CLI installed (brew install gh)
- gh authenticated to github.com (gh auth login --hostname github.com)
</string>
